# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build context for the caller-agent image (see code/caller-agent/Dockerfile).
# Build context is the repo root so the Dockerfile can reach `personas.json`
# at the top level (referenced by code/shared/ContactCenterAgent.Shared/
# ContactCenterAgent.Shared.csproj as ..\..\..\personas.json).
#
# Allowlist style: ignore everything, then un-ignore only what caller-agent
# needs. The admin-chat image uses code/admin-chat/ as its own context and
# is unaffected by this file.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Ignore everything by default
**

# --- Files needed at the build root ---
!personas.json

# --- Folders the caller-agent build needs ---
!code/caller-agent/
!code/caller-agent/**
!code/shared/
!code/shared/**

# --- Re-exclude junk inside allowed folders ---
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/.vs/
**/Properties/launchSettings.json
**/appsettings.Development.json
**/*.user
**/*.suo
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
